koronus-space-veil-description = Beyond the system's worlds, violet clouds and thin dust streams cross the distant starfield. Fleeting trails and distant navigation lights occasionally pass through the void.
koronus-space-ember-description = Copper-coloured clouds and drifting ash-dark dust stretch behind the system's orbits. Brief streaks of light occasionally cross the distant haze.
koronus-space-frost-description = Pale blue haze and sparse dust trails frame the system's distant stars. Isolated lights sometimes drift across the background.
koronus-space-abyss-description = Faint violet wisps mark the deep void beyond the system's worlds. A rare passing light briefly breaks the darkness.
